            <ArticleTitle>Some pharmacological and toxicological studies on ketoprofen.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>5-10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Evidence for the effectiveness of ketoprofen in animal models of inflammation and its antipyretic effect is reviewed. Its toxicity in animals is discussed and the low tendency to produce ulcers is stressed.</AbstractText>
